# Labwc autostart — run by labwc after startup, PATH comes from the
# systemd user service (/run/current-system/sw/bin).
#
# Raise the headless output's initial mode. noVNC's resize=remote drives
# the actual desktop size per client (RFB SetDesktopSize via wayvnc);
# this only sets the ceiling so a zoomed pane can pull more pixels.
wlr-randr --output HEADLESS-1 --custom-mode 1920x1080@60Hz
